<section class="section"><div class="wrap privacy-copy"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</div><h1>Inquiry privacy notice</h1><p>When a parent or guardian submits a free class request, Virtual Tech Vibes Academy collects their name and phone number, the child’s name, class and age, program interest, and any optional message.</p><h2>Why we collect it</h2><p>We use these details to respond to your inquiry, discuss appropriate learning programs, and arrange a free class. Sending a request does not confirm a booking or enrolment.</p><h2>Where your inquiry goes</h2><p>Inquiries are stored in the academy’s application database. If you choose a Google Maps link, that service’s own privacy terms apply.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>Please submit this form only as a parent or guardian. Avoid including sensitive information in the optional message. To request a correction, deletion, or to ask us to stop contacting you, call <a href="tel:+911204033740">0120-4033740</a>.</p><h2>Essential cookies</h2><p>The site uses session and security cookies to process forms and display confirmation or validation messages.</p><a href="{{ route('free-class') }}" class="button button-red">Back to your inquiry <x-icon/></a></div></section>
